<section class="community-banner"><div class="community-left"><div class="discord-orb">◉</div><div><h2>JOIN THE BOY KING TUT COMMUNITY</h2><p>Community · Crypto · Affiliates · Updates</p><a href="https://discord.gg/HA73BUfJ67" target="_blank">Discord.gg/HA73BUfJ67</a></div></div><div class="community-actions"><span>◉ Live Updates</span><span>↗ Trading Alerts</span><span>♙ Member Support</span><span>♛ Community Events</span></div></section>

<section class="why-strip"><h2>WHY CHOOSE BOY KING TUT</h2><div><article><b>$</b><span>ON-CHAIN PAYMENTS<small>Solana verification</small></span></article><article><b>◷</b><span>5-MINUTE QUOTE<small>Live SOL price</small></span></article><article><b>☵</b><span>COMMUNITY<small>Discord</small></span></article><article><b>✪</b><span>DASHBOARDS<small>Customer · Affiliate · Admin</small></span></article><article><b>▯</b><span>MOBILE FRIENDLY<small>Access anywhere</small></span></article></div></section>

<section id="pricing" class="page-section"><h2>Pricing & Access</h2><div class="pricing-grid"><article class="price-card"><strong>$50</strong><b>Crypto Basic</b><small>Monthly</small></article><article class="price-card"><strong>$150</strong><b>Crypto Pro</b><small>Monthly</small></article><article class="price-card"><strong>$300</strong><b>Solo Machine</b><small>One-time hardware order</small></article><article class="price-card"><strong>$250–$500</strong><b>Local Advertising</b><small>Monthly package options</small></article></div></section>

<section id="faq" class="page-section"><h2>FAQ</h2><details><summary>How are Solana payments verified?</summary><p>A checkout quote uses the live SOL/USD rate, is locked for five minutes, and the submitted transaction signature is verified against the Solana blockchain.</p></details><details><summary>Does BoyKingTut.com hold my crypto?</summary><p>No. Keep control of your own wallet and credentials. Never share a seed phrase or private key.</p></details><details><summary>Is leverage trading guaranteed?</summary><p>No. Leverage trading is high-risk and can result in rapid or total loss.</p></details><details><summary>Is BoyKingTut.com a travel agency?</summary><p>No. Egypt content is informational/educational. Flights and travel services are arranged independently.</p></details></section>
</main>

<script is:inline>
const g=document.getElementById("ageGate"),c=document.getElementById("ageCheck"),e=document.getElementById("enterBtn"),l=document.getElementById("leaveBtn"),j=document.getElementById("jobPopup"),x=document.getElementById("closeJob");
if(sessionStorage.getItem("bkt18")==="yes"){g.hidden=true}else{document.body.classList.add("locked")}
c?.addEventListener("change",()=>{e.disabled=!c.checked});
e?.addEventListener("click",()=>{sessionStorage.setItem("bkt18","yes");g.hidden=true;document.body.classList.remove("locked");if(localStorage.getItem("bktJob")!=="seen")setTimeout(()=>j.hidden=false,1200)});
l?.addEventListener("click",()=>location.href="https://www.google.com/");
x?.addEventListener("click",()=>{j.hidden=true;localStorage.setItem("bktJob","seen")});
</script>
</BaseLayout>
